Vintage-style illustration of a fantastical theme park landscape at golden hour, featuring towering ancient Egyptian pyramids alongside lush prehistoric jungle with animatronic dinosaurs peeking through dense foliage, a medieval castle with dragon-shaped roller coaster tracks winding around its turrets, and a futuristic chrome cityscape in the distance. In the foreground, gleaming 1950s classic cars with chrome fins sit parked near palm trees. The scene is rendered with warm sepia tones, slightly faded edges, and the rich saturated colors of mid-century travel posters. Water splashes dramatically from a log flume ride cutting through the jungle section, catching the amber sunset light. The composition feels like a nostalgic postcard memory, blending multiple fantasy worlds into one cohesive dreamscape vista.
